msgid "gmolpro graphical user interface"
msgstr "gmolpro 图形用户界面"

msgid "`introduction to gmolpro <https://vimeo.com/493402264>`__"
msgstr "`gmolpro 简介 <https://vimeo.com/493402264>`__"

msgid ""
"gmolpro is a GTK-based graphical interface to Molpro that runs on Linux and "
"macOS workstations."
msgstr "gmolpro 是基于 GTK 的 Molpro 图形界面，可在 Linux 和 macOS 工作站上运行。"

msgid ""
"Basic Molpro inputs can be very quickly generated. Sensible basis sets and "
"input parameters are suggested. The preparation of inputs is supported "
"through an expert system that interacts with Molpro’s registry of commands, "
"methods, and basis sets, guiding the user toward feasible combinations of "
"calculation types (single point, optimization, etc.), methods, basis sets, "
"and options."
msgstr ""
"可以非常快速地生成基本的 Molpro 输入。程序会建议合理的基组和输入参数。输入的准备工作由一个专家系统提供支持，该系统与 Molpro "
"的命令、方法和基组注册表交互，引导用户选择可行的计算类型（单点、优化等）、方法、基组和选项组合。"

msgid ""
"Checks are implemented so that the geometry, charge, and spin are "
"consistent, and only appropriate methods are selected. Reasonable default "
"settings are provided so that an input can be easily set up. It also "
"provides a plain-text editor to allow further editing of existing job "
"inputs, or simply copy in general input files."
msgstr ""
"程序中实现了检查机制，以确保几何结构、电荷和自旋相互一致，并且只选择合适的方法。提供了合理的默认设置，使得输入可以轻松建立。它还提供一个纯文本编辑器，允许进一步编辑现有的作业输入，或直接粘贴通用输入文件。"

msgid ""
"Molecular structures can be constructed and edited using an integrated "
"builder derived from the `PQSMol <http://www.pqs-chem.com/software.php>`__ "
"interface to the `PQS <http://www.pqs-chem.com/software.php>`__ package, see"
" also the `corresponding manual (pdf file) <http://www.pqs-"
"chem.com/downloads/PQSMol-man.pdf>`__. It incorporates fragment libraries "
"(over 200 molecules and functional groups), force fields, and an "
"optimization based on force fields. Jobs can then be submitted and managed "
"on the local computer or a remote machine."
msgstr ""
"分子结构可使用集成的构建器来构建和编辑，该构建器源自 `PQS <http://www.pqs-chem.com/software.php>`__ "
"软件包的 `PQSMol <http://www.pqs-chem.com/software.php>`__ 界面，另请参阅 `相应的手册（pdf "
"文件） <http://www.pqs-chem.com/downloads/PQSMol-man.pdf>`__\\ 。它包含片段库（超过 200 "
"个分子和官能团）、力场以及基于力场的优化。随后可以在本地计算机或远程机器上提交和管理作业。"

msgid ""
"Visualisation of results includes interactive display of structures (also "
"for the individual optimisation steps), orbitals, property maps, and "
"vibrational modes. Outputs from Molpro calculations set up with gmolpro, as "
"well as output files from general input files can be visualised; e.g. "
"orbitals with all angular momenta implemented in Molpro (*s, p, d, f, g, h, "
"i*) may be quickly visualised."
msgstr ""
"结果的图形化显示包括结构的交互式显示（也可显示各个优化步骤）、轨道、性质图和振动模式。使用 gmolpro 建立的 Molpro "
"计算的输出，以及通用输入文件的输出文件，均可进行图形化显示；例如，Molpro 中实现的具有各角动量的轨道（\\ *s, p, d, f, g, h, "
"i*\\ ）可以快速显示。"

msgid ""
"one of the i-orbitals: `window-h-i6plus-occupied.png <media/window-h-i6plus-"
"occupied.png>`__"
msgstr ""
"其中一个 i 轨道：\\ `window-h-i6plus-occupied.png <media/window-h-i6plus-"
"occupied.png>`__"

msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr "前提条件"

msgid ""
"gmolpro (present release: version 2.8.0) should be used together with "
"Molpro2025.2. On Mac, the package you download is already bundled with this "
"Molpro version. On Linux, gmolpro does not come bundled with Molpro, and you"
" need a separate installation of Molpro. Note that on macOS, gmolpro starts "
"without visiting shell initialisation scripts if you start it by clicking on"
" the icon in the Mac Dock."
msgstr ""
"gmolpro（当前版本：2.8.0 版）应与 Molpro2025.2 配合使用。在 Mac 上，所下载的软件包已捆绑此 Molpro 版本。在 "
"Linux 上，gmolpro 不随 Molpro 捆绑发布，因此需要单独安装 Molpro。请注意，在 macOS 上，如果通过点击 Mac Dock"
" 中的图标启动 gmolpro，则不会执行 shell 初始化脚本。"

msgid "It requires"
msgstr "它需要"

msgid ""
"a macOS (12.X i.e. Monterey or later) or Linux (Ubuntu 18.04 or later, "
"Debian 11 or later, Fedora  42 or later, or openSUSE 15.6 or later) "
"workstation; other macOS or Linux versions ***may (and often will)*** work"
msgstr ""
"macOS（12.X，即 Monterey 或更高版本）或 Linux（Ubuntu 18.04 或更高版本、Debian 11 "
"或更高版本、Fedora 42 或更高版本，或 openSUSE 15.6 或更高版本）工作站；其他 macOS 或 Linux "
"版本***可能（且通常确实会）***正常工作"

msgid ""
"a licence token which is valid for molpro and gmolpro. It may be installed "
"in ``$HOME/.molpro/token`` . Alternatively (useful for group licences) on "
"Linux, it may be installed in the place as described in the "
":doc:`installation_guide <installation_guide>`, and on Mac in "
"``/Applications/gmolpro.app/Contents/Resources/molpro/lib/.token`` (the "
"gmolpro app should always be installed in the default place "
"``/Applications/gmolpro.app`` )"
msgstr ""
"对 molpro 和 gmolpro 有效的许可证令牌。它可以安装在 ``$HOME/.molpro/token`` "
"中。另外（对于集团许可证很有用），在 Linux 上，它可以安装在 :doc:`installation_guide "
"<installation_guide>` 中所述的位置，而在 Mac 上安装在 "
"``/Applications/gmolpro.app/Contents/Resources/molpro/lib/.token`` 中（gmolpro"
" 应用程序应始终安装在默认位置 ``/Applications/gmolpro.app``\\ ）"

