msgid "Projects"
msgstr "项目"

msgid ""
"All files belonging to a particular calculation (input, output, geometry "
"etc.), as well as additional data, are contained in a *project*, which is "
"implemented as a filesystem directory (a bundle). gMolpro automatically "
"creates and maintains these projects. Project directories have extension "
"``.molpro``, e.g. ``c2h2.molpro``."
msgstr ""
"属于某次计算的所有文件（输入、输出、几何结构等）以及附加数据都包含在一个\\ *项目*\\ "
"中，该项目以文件系统目录（bundle）的形式实现。gMolpro 会自动创建并维护这些项目。项目目录的扩展名为 ``.molpro``\\ ，例如 "
"``c2h2.molpro``\\ 。"

msgid "Starting gMolpro"
msgstr "启动 gMolpro"

msgid "`starting gmolpro <https://vimeo.com/471037256>`__"
msgstr "`启动 gmolpro <https://vimeo.com/471037256>`__"

msgid ""
"gmolpro can be started either by typing ``gmolpro`` in a terminal window, or"
" by launching the gmolpro application in the way that is usual on your "
"system.  When it opens, you are presented with the splash screen, which "
"gives the opportunity to start a new project or open an existing one. Let's "
"make a new one. We are first of all prompted to specify where to save it; "
"from that point on, all changes to the project are written immediately to "
"file without any save or similar commands. Next, we see two windows, denoted"
" *input* (blue) and *build* (lilac). In the input window, we can set  "
"parameters for the calculation, whereas in the build window, we construct "
"the molecular geometry. Let's construct a favourite molecule by taking it "
"from the built-in library of molecular fragments. There is more you can do "
"to build and edit the structure, but for now we will switch to the input "
"window and run a calculation. We need to tell it at the minimum what method "
"(let's choose B3LYP) to use, and for now we will just leave all other "
"options alone. We can then use the ``Run`` button to launch the job. At this"
" point, it is fine to close the project even if the job has not yet "
"finished; we are then returned to the splash screen, where you can open "
"another project, or quit."
msgstr ""
"gmolpro 既可以在终端窗口中输入 ``gmolpro`` 启动，也可以按照你系统上的常规方式启动 gmolpro "
"应用程序。打开后会显示启动画面，你可以在其中新建项目或打开已有项目。我们来新建一个项目。首先会提示我们指定保存位置；从那一刻起，对项目的所有更改都会立即写入文件，无需任何保存或类似命令。接下来，我们看到两个窗口，分别称为"
" *input*\\ （蓝色）和 *build*\\ （淡紫色）。在 input 窗口中，我们可以设置计算参数，而在 build "
"窗口中，我们构建分子几何结构。我们从内置的分子片段库中取一个常用分子来构建它。构建和编辑结构还有更多操作，但现在我们先切换到 input "
"窗口并运行一次计算。至少需要告诉它使用什么方法（我们选 B3LYP），目前其他选项都保持默认即可。然后我们可以使用 ``Run`` "
"按钮启动作业。此时，即使作业尚未完成，也可以关闭项目；随后会返回启动画面，在那里可以打开另一个项目，或退出。"

msgid "Windows"
msgstr "窗口"

msgid ""
"gMolpro displays four different windows. The ``input`` (blue) and ``build`` "
"(lilac) windows support preparation of a job, where as the ``output`` "
"(white), ``view`` (brown) windows, which appear only once a job has started,"
" show results. Switching between windows can be achieved using the "
"``Windows`` menu or with the keyboard shortcuts shown in the menu."
msgstr ""
"gMolpro 显示四个不同的窗口。\\ ``input``\\ （蓝色）和 ``build``\\ （淡紫色）窗口用于准备作业，而 "
"``output``\\ （白色）和 ``view``\\ （棕色）窗口仅在作业启动后出现，用于显示结果。可以使用 ``Windows`` "
"菜单或菜单中显示的键盘快捷键在窗口之间切换。"

msgid "Input Window (blue)"
msgstr "输入窗口（蓝色）"

msgid "`input window <https://vimeo.com/778042061>`__"
msgstr "`输入窗口 <https://vimeo.com/778042061>`__"

msgid ""
"The window guides though the options for a calculation, constructing Molpro "
"input for DFT and single-reference calculations. Generally, one should go "
"through this window from top to bottom, since some settings depend on each "
"other. Let's look at the possibilities. The geometry can be imported from an"
" xyz file(``Import Geometry``) or generated using the ``Builder Window``. "
"Imported xyz files are not modified in the project, but can change during "
"the calculation due to orientation or geometry optimization, and the "
"optimized geometries can be exported and reused in subsequent calculations. "
"The next important decision is the overall type of calculation - single "
"geometry or structure optimization, with or without harmonic frequencies.  "
"We should then choose the method; let's try a correlated-wavefunction "
"CCSD(T) calculation. The default for the Hamiltonian model is to use "
"pseudopotentials to represent core electrons where appropriate, but you can "
"choose instead to include all electrons, either non-relativistically or with"
" a scalar relativistic Hamiltonian. There is also the possibility to specify"
" whether and how core orbitals are included in the correlation treatment. "
"The final principal choice is the basis set. The guided proposals for this "
"are dependent on the method, Hamiltonian and core correlation. You should "
"first choose the overall quality - double, triple,... zeta - and then select"
" within that if desired. It's also possible to specify the basis set element"
" by element.  The remainder of the input is associated with further options "
"to control the running of the calculation and what it produces."
msgstr ""
"该窗口引导用户完成计算选项，为 DFT 和单参考计算构建 Molpro "
"输入。通常应从上到下依次浏览此窗口，因为某些设置相互依赖。我们来看看这些可能性。几何结构可以从 xyz 文件导入（\\ ``Import "
"Geometry``\\ ），也可以使用 ``Builder Window`` 生成。导入的 xyz "
"文件不会在项目中被修改，但在计算过程中可能因取向或几何优化而改变，优化后的几何结构可以导出并在后续计算中复用。下一个重要决定是计算的整体类型——单点几何结构还是结构优化，是否包含谐振频率。然后应选择方法；我们来尝试相关波函数"
" CCSD(T) 计算。Hamiltonian "
"模型的默认做法是在适当情况下使用赝势代表芯电子，但你也可以选择包含所有电子，可以采用非相对论方式或标量相对论 "
"Hamiltonian。此外还可以指定是否以及如何将芯轨道纳入相关处理。最后一项主要选择是基组。为此提供的引导建议取决于方法、Hamiltonian "
"和芯层相关。你应首先选择总体质量——double、triple……zeta——然后在此基础上根据需要选择。也可以逐元素指定基组。输入的其余部分涉及控制计算运行方式及其输出的更多选项。"

msgid "**Further notes:**"
msgstr "**补充说明：**"

msgid ""
"Density fitting can be switched on or off by clicking the ``Density "
"Fitting`` button (depending on the method)."
msgstr "可以通过点击 ``Density Fitting`` 按钮开启或关闭密度拟合（取决于方法）。"

msgid ""
"``Pseudopot. if available`` means to use (small core) pseudopotentials "
"together with the associated basis sets when these are available (heavier "
"elements), and all-electron basis sets for all other elements."
msgstr ""
"``Pseudopot. if available`` 表示在可用时（较重元素）使用（小芯）赝势及与其关联的基组，而对所有其他元素使用全电子基组。"

msgid ""
"``Core-correlation:`` ``mixed`` means to include outer core orbitals for "
"elements left of the p-block in the periodic system. ``small`` means also to"
" include (outer) core orbitals of other elements. Note that the basis sets "
"depend on these settings."
msgstr ""
"``Core-correlation:`` 中的 ``mixed`` 表示为周期表中 p 区左侧的元素包含外层芯轨道。\\ ``small`` "
"表示也包含其他元素的（外层）芯轨道。请注意，基组取决于这些设置。"

msgid ""
"``Basis sets:`` first choose the quality (e.g. TZ, QZ), and then the default"
" basis set. The recommended basis sets depend on the method. If the default "
"basis is not available for some atom(s), or the use of other basis sets is "
"desired for some atoms, use the element specific basis pulldown menu."
msgstr ""
"``Basis sets:`` 首先选择质量（例如 "
"TZ、QZ），然后选择默认基组。推荐的基组取决于方法。如果默认基组对某些原子不可用，或者希望某些原子使用其他基组，请使用元素特定基组下拉菜单。"

msgid ""
"The right-hand pane showing the input is not directly editable when in "
"\"guided mode\". However, one can leave guided mode by clicking on this "
"pane, and then any valid Molpro input can be entered.  It is not possible to"
" return to guided mode once it has been left. Externally-created projects "
"also will open in this freehand mode."
msgstr ""
"显示输入的右侧窗格在“引导模式”下不可直接编辑。不过，可以点击此窗格离开引导模式，然后即可输入任何有效的 Molpro "
"输入。一旦离开引导模式，就无法返回。外部创建的项目也会以此自由模式打开。"

msgid "Builder Window (lilac)"
msgstr "构建窗口（淡紫色）"

msgid "`starting gmolpro <https://vimeo.com/778043408>`__"
msgstr "`启动 gmolpro <https://vimeo.com/778043408>`__"

msgid ""
"This window is used to build and pre-optimize molecular structures. On the "
"right-hand side one can choose building blocks or fragments, which are then "
"connected to the molecule in the left window. This is best illustrated by an"
" example. Let’s build glycine, NH\\ :sub:`2`\\ CH\\ :sub:`2`\\ COOH. The "
"easiest is of course to take it from the provided structures (click fragment"
" - amino_acids - gly), but we can also build it step by step. Click "
"``Building Blocks``, choose ``C`` in the periodic table, click on the symbol"
" for C with 4 single bonds. The atom appears in the ``Segment Window``. "
"Click ``+`` in the lower icon list under the left window and click on the "
"left window. The C-atom is copied to that position. Now continue to add the "
"NH\\ :sub:`2` group: Click on ``Fragments``, ``FUNCTIONAL_GROUPS``, "
"``amino``. Then click in the left window on the dangling bond to which you "
"want to add the amino group. Next add the COOH group similarly. At this "
"point, we have the full structure, but with some remaining dangling bonds "
"that should be terminated with hydrogen. We do this by clicking on ``H`` in "
"the upper left corner of the left window. Conformational and other "
"adjustments can be carried out by, for example, rotating about bonds: click "
"``Rotate About a Bond`` in the bottom list of the left window, select the "
"bond by clicking on it, then drag with the mouse to rotate. The structure "
"can be preoptimized using a force field via the ``Optimize`` menu on top of "
"the left window, or ``Optimize`` upper button."
msgstr ""
"此窗口用于构建和预优化分子结构。在右侧可以选择构建块或片段，然后将其连接到左侧窗口中的分子上。用示例来说明最好。我们来构建甘氨酸 NH\\ "
":sub:`2`\\ CH\\ :sub:`2`\\ COOH。最简单的方法当然是从提供的结构中选择（点击 fragment - amino_acids"
" - gly），但我们也可以逐步构建它。点击 ``Building Blocks``\\ ，在周期表中选择 ``C``\\ ，点击具有 4 个单键的 C"
" 符号。该原子会出现在 ``Segment Window`` 中。点击左侧窗口下方图标列表中的 ``+``\\ ，然后点击左侧窗口。C "
"原子会复制到该位置。现在继续添加 NH\\ :sub:`2` 基团：点击 ``Fragments``\\ 、\\ "
"``FUNCTIONAL_GROUPS``\\ 、\\ ``amino``\\ 。然后在左侧窗口中点击你希望添加氨基所连接的悬挂键。接下来以同样方式添加"
" COOH 基团。此时我们已有完整结构，但还残留一些应以氢终止的悬挂键。我们通过点击左侧窗口左上角的 ``H`` "
"来完成。构象和其他调整可以通过例如绕键旋转来进行：点击左侧窗口底部列表中的 ``Rotate About a Bond``\\ "
"，点击某根键将其选中，然后用鼠标拖动来旋转。可以使用左侧窗口顶部的 ``Optimize`` 菜单或上方 ``Optimize`` "
"按钮通过力场对结构进行预优化。"

msgid "Output window (white)"
msgstr "输出窗口（白色）"

msgid "`output window <media/output_window.jpg>`__"
msgstr "`输出窗口 <media/output_window.jpg>`__"

msgid ""
"This window displays, with continuous update, the raw output produced by "
"Molpro once the job has started. A second tab is provided for inspecting the"
" log file that is used, for example, in geometry optimisations."
msgstr "此窗口持续更新显示作业启动后 Molpro 生成的原始输出。另外还提供一个标签页，用于查看例如几何优化中所使用的日志文件。"

msgid "View window (brown)"
msgstr "查看窗口（棕色）"

msgid "`starting gmolpro <https://vimeo.com/471041694>`__"
msgstr "`启动 gmolpro <https://vimeo.com/471041694>`__"

msgid ""
"The view window shows the final structure, ie after any geometry "
"optimisation. It can also be used to display properties such as vibrational "
"modes and orbitals, as well as the history of the geometry optimisation.  In"
" this example, a geometry optimisation and frequency calculation has already"
" been carried out for glycine, and localised orbitals have been obtained. "
"Notice that, as in the build window, you can alter the view, rotating by "
"dragging with the mouse, or zooming using the centre mouse button (Linux) or"
" command-key and mouse (macOS). First, let's check what happened in the "
"optimisation by clicking the ``Optimization History`` button. We can play a "
"movie of the optimisation, or pick a particular point and export its "
"geometry. The ``Vibrational Frequencies`` button shows the spectrum, from "
"which individual modes can be selected and animated. The ``Orbitals`` "
"buttons brings up an energy level diagram from which individual orbitals can"
" be selected. If more than one type of orbital has been calculated, you can "
"choose the active set. Choose further display options from the "
"``Display/Orbital`` menu."
msgstr ""
"查看窗口显示最终结构，即经过任何几何优化之后的结构。它还可以用于显示振动模式和轨道等性质，以及几何优化的历史记录。在此示例中，已经对甘氨酸进行了几何优化和频率计算，并获得了局域化轨道。请注意，与构建窗口一样，你可以改变视图：用鼠标拖动旋转，或使用中键（Linux）或"
" Command 键加鼠标（macOS）进行缩放。首先，我们点击 ``Optimization History`` "
"按钮查看优化过程中发生了什么。我们可以播放优化过程的动画，或选取某个特定点并导出其几何结构。\\ ``Vibrational Frequencies``"
" 按钮显示光谱，从中可以选择各个模式并播放动画。\\ ``Orbitals`` "
"按钮会调出能级图，从中可以选择各个轨道。如果计算了多种类型的轨道，你可以选择活动集。可从 ``Display/Orbital`` "
"菜单中选择更多显示选项。"

msgid "Running calculations on remote servers"
msgstr "在远程服务器上运行计算"

msgid "`running on remote servers <https://vimeo.com/778043635>`__"
msgstr "`在远程服务器上运行 <https://vimeo.com/778043635>`__"

msgid ""
"When you click ``Run`` in the input window, by default, the calculation will"
" be run on your local machine. gmolpro needs a local installation of Molpro."
" Support for running the calculation on another machine, with options such "
"as process number and memory, is provided. One or more *backends* are "
"defined in a file ``~/.sjef/molpro/backends.xml``. A backend is simply a "
"specification of commands to launch, check and kill a job, and patterns to "
"interpret status checks. One can then select which backend is assigned to "
"the project, and this selection is remembered in the project's registry. The"
" run command defined in the backend can be simply ``molpro``, or might be "
"the name of a custom script to present a job to a scheduler such as Slurm.  "
"The name of the command can be followed by parameters, which can also be "
"specified in substitutable form, which lets you define per-project options "
"to be used in the job submission and (optionally) their default values, e.g."
" for memory, number of parallel processes, job-scheduling parameters etc. "
"These values can be modified in the \"Run parameters\" pulldown for a chosen"
" backend."
msgstr ""
"当你在输入窗口中点击 ``Run`` 时，默认情况下计算将在本地机器上运行。gmolpro 需要本地安装 "
"Molpro。它还支持在另一台机器上运行计算，并提供进程数和内存等选项。一个或多个\\ *后端*\\ 定义在文件 "
"``~/.sjef/molpro/backends.xml`` "
"中。后端实际上就是一组用于启动、检查和终止作业的命令，以及用于解释状态检查的模式。然后可以选择将哪个后端分配给项目，这一选择会记录在项目的注册表中。后端中定义的运行命令可以只是"
" ``molpro``\\ ，也可以是自定义脚本的名称，以便将作业提交给 Slurm "
"等调度器。命令名称后面可以跟参数，这些参数也可以以可替换形式指定，从而让你定义在作业提交中使用的每项目选项及其（可选）默认值，例如内存、并行进程数、作业调度参数等。对于选定的后端，这些值可以在“Run"
" parameters”下拉菜单中修改。"

msgid ""
"Configuring a backend is requires usually just the hostname (which will be "
"connected to with ssh, and which should be accessible without password; the "
"shell on the remote machine is expected to be able to execute basic shell "
"commands) and the name of the run command.  The run command script may "
"contain any specified options, followed by a single argument that is the "
"name of the input to Molpro. The ``molpro`` command conforms to this; for "
"more complex requirements, for example for constructing a batch job, a "
"wrapper script will be needed. Further help is available on `the detailed "
"syntax of the backend.xml file "
"<https://molpro.gitlab.io/sjef/master/md__builds_molpro_sjef_lib_backends.html>`__."
msgstr ""
"配置后端通常只需要主机名（将通过 ssh 连接，并且应能无密码访问；远程机器上的 shell 应能执行基本的 shell "
"命令）以及运行命令的名称。运行命令脚本可以包含任何指定的选项，其后跟单个参数，即 Molpro 输入的名称。\\ ``molpro`` "
"命令符合此要求；对于更复杂的需求，例如构造批处理作业，则需要包装脚本。更多帮助请参见 `the detailed syntax of the "
"backend.xml file "
"<https://molpro.gitlab.io/sjef/master/md__builds_molpro_sjef_lib_backends.html>`__\\"
" 。"

msgid "If you wish to launch jobs on remote systems:"
msgstr "如果希望在远程系统上启动作业："

msgid ""
"a file ``~/.sjef/molpro/backends.xml`` is necessary on the local machine, "
"which specifies the remote machine and how jobs are submitted"
msgstr "本地机器上需要文件 ``~/.sjef/molpro/backends.xml``\\ ，用于指定远程机器以及作业的提交方式"

msgid ""
"Molpro must be installed on the remote machine. Jobs will fail if Molpro is "
"not found on the remote machine."
msgstr "远程机器上必须安装 Molpro。如果在远程机器上找不到 Molpro，作业将会失败。"

msgid ""
"If jobs are managed by a scheduler, an appropriate script that constructs "
"and submits the job is needed, with the name of the input file as its single"
" argument, possibly preceded by options."
msgstr "如果作业由调度器管理，则需要一个适当的脚本来自构造并提交作业，其唯一参数为输入文件的名称，前面可能带有选项。"

msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "常见问题"

msgid "Frequencies or optimisation cannot be visualised - icon is greyed out"
msgstr "无法可视化频率或优化——图标灰显"

msgid ""
"The GUI searches for orbitals, and then displays which properties are "
"available for these orbitals. Default is the last set of orbitals. If there "
"is more than one set of orbitals, then it may be necessary to load a "
"different set of orbitals. E.g. in DFT calculations, the orbitals may be "
"written again at the very end. Then it may be necessary to load a set of "
"orbitals written before, to be able to visualise frequencies."
msgstr ""
"GUI 会搜索轨道，然后显示这些轨道可用的属性。默认使用最后一组轨道。如果存在多组轨道，则可能需要加载不同的轨道组。例如，在 DFT "
"计算中，轨道可能会在最后再次写出。此时可能需要加载先前写出的轨道组，以便可视化频率。"

msgid "Orbitals cannot be visualised - icon is greyed out"
msgstr "无法可视化轨道——图标灰显"

msgid ""
"Molpro must be run with flags ``--xml-output --xml-orbdump``    , i.e.:"
msgstr "Molpro 必须使用 ``--xml-output --xml-orbdump`` 标志运行，即："

msgid "``molpro --xml-output --xml-orbdump myinput.inp``"
msgstr "``molpro --xml-output --xml-orbdump myinput.inp``"

msgid "Some hints"
msgstr "一些提示"

msgid "Visualise results from any Molpro calculation"
msgstr "可视化任何 Molpro 计算的结果"

msgid ""
"If you did not use the GUI to generate the input, but want to visualise the "
"output, then this can be done in the following way:"
msgstr "如果没有使用 GUI 生成输入，但希望可视化输出，可以按以下方式进行："

msgid "run your input (e.g. h2o-demo.inp)"
msgstr "运行输入（例如 h2o-demo.inp）"

msgid "h2o-demo.inp"
msgstr "h2o-demo.inp"

msgid "with flags to generate xml output and orbitals in xml format"
msgstr "使用标志生成 xml 输出和 xml 格式的轨道"

msgid "``molpro --xml-output --xml-orbdump  h2o-demo.inp``"
msgstr "``molpro --xml-output --xml-orbdump  h2o-demo.inp``"

msgid "start gmolpro"
msgstr "启动 gmolpro"

msgid "click on \"New project\", and choose a project name such as e.g.:  dummy"
msgstr "点击 \"New project\"，并选择一个项目名称，例如：dummy"

msgid ""
"In any of the windows which open, in the toolbar at the top, there is a "
"pulldown menu with an item"
msgstr "在打开的任何窗口中，顶部工具栏有一个下拉菜单，其中包含一项"

msgid "Window/Visualise results from/Molpro output (xml)"
msgstr "Window/Visualise results from/Molpro output (xml)"

msgid "and then choose  h2o-demo.xml"
msgstr "然后选择 h2o-demo.xml"

msgid ""
"The brown window opens, and there you may now visualise orbitals, go through"
" the optimisation, animate frequencies etc."
msgstr "将打开棕色窗口，现在可以在其中可视化轨道、浏览优化过程、动画显示频率等。"

msgid "Visualize an input structure"
msgstr "可视化输入结构"

msgid "To check a structure used in an input file, proceed like this:"
msgstr "要检查输入文件中使用的结构，请按以下步骤操作："

msgid "Run the input, in addition with the flag --geometry"
msgstr "运行输入，并附加 --geometry 标志"

msgid "``molpro --geometry --xml-output --xml-orbdump  my-molecule.inp``"
msgstr "``molpro --geometry --xml-output --xml-orbdump  my-molecule.inp``"

msgid ""
"Note that it needs at least one jobstep, e.g. \"hf\" though this jobstep "
"will not be executed. Proceed as in \"Visualise results from any Molpro "
"calculation\":"
msgstr "注意它至少需要一个作业步，例如 \"hf\"，尽管该作业步不会被执行。按照 \"可视化任何 Molpro 计算的结果\" 中的步骤操作："

msgid ""
"2,3,4) start gmolpro; click on \"New project\", and choose a project name "
"such as e.g.: \"dummy\"; use the pulldown item Window/Visualise results "
"from/Molpro output (xml), and then choose my-molecule.xml"
msgstr ""
"2,3,4) 启动 gmolpro；点击 \"New project\"，并选择一个项目名称，例如：\"dummy\"；使用下拉项 "
"Window/Visualise results from/Molpro output (xml)，然后选择 my-molecule.xml"

msgid "Input files with more than one optimisation etc"
msgstr "含多个优化等的输入文件"

msgid ""
"In freehand input or with input files not generated with the GUI, more "
"general xml files can be generated. Output files (xml files) with several "
"optimisations, frequency calculations, or even different molecules within "
"one xml file can be handled. Start from the brown window, open the orbital "
"window, and then select and load an orbital set. A corresponding "
"optimisation or vibrational modes may now be displayed."
msgstr ""
"在自由手写输入中，或使用非 GUI 生成的输入文件时，可以生成更通用的 xml 文件。包含多个优化、频率计算、甚至一个 xml "
"文件内含不同分子的输出文件（xml 文件）均可处理。从棕色窗口开始，打开轨道窗口，然后选择并加载一个轨道集。此时可能会显示相应的优化或振动模式。"

msgid "More general inputs"
msgstr "更通用的输入"

msgid ""
"The GUI helps to quickly generate a basic input. If you want a more general "
"input, you can (in the blue window) in any stage click on the button "
"\"Switch to free-hand input\". Now you can edit the input manually. You may "
"then run the input from the GUI with the \"Run\" button, and visualise with "
"the brown window."
msgstr ""
"GUI 有助于快速生成基本输入。如果需要更通用的输入，可以在蓝色窗口中任意阶段点击 \"Switch to free-hand input\" "
"按钮。现在即可手动编辑输入。随后可以用 \"Run\" 按钮从 GUI 运行该输入，并用棕色窗口进行可视化。"

msgid "Using the builder alone: general hints"
msgstr "单独使用 builder：一般性提示"

msgid ""
"Already the builder alone is very powerful. Besides building molecules, it "
"contains a large database of pre-built molecules. Also, a force-field "
"optimisation may be performed, the point group determined etc. The "
"geometries in the builder are continuously saved to a file within the "
"project. E.g. if the project is called mymolecule.molpro , then the xyz file"
" of the molecule is stored in mymolecule.molpro/mymolecule.xyz . Obviously, "
"this file may be copied to some other place, used by other programs etc."
msgstr ""
"仅 builder 本身就已非常强大。除构建分子外，它还包含大量预构建分子的数据库。此外还可以执行力场优化、确定点群等。builder "
"中的几何结构会持续保存到项目内的一个文件中。例如若项目名为 mymolecule.molpro ，则分子的 xyz 文件存储在 "
"mymolecule.molpro/mymolecule.xyz 中。显然，该文件可以复制到其他地方，供其他程序使用等。"

msgid ""
"Using the builder alone: visualise an xyz file or a trajectory (set of xyz "
"files)"
msgstr "单独使用 builder：可视化 xyz 文件或轨迹（一组 xyz 文件）"

msgid ""
"To visualise an xyz file, start gmolpro, and open a new project. Then do "
"``Geometry/Import to builder window ...`` and select the xyz file to be "
"visualised."
msgstr ""
"要可视化 xyz 文件，请启动 gmolpro 并打开一个新项目。然后执行 ``Geometry/Import to builder window "
"...`` 并选择要可视化的 xyz 文件。"

msgid ""
"This allows also to visualise a trajectory. The trajectory must be a set of "
"xyz files appended to each other."
msgstr "这样还可以可视化轨迹。轨迹必须是一组依次追加的 xyz 文件。"

msgid "Running several instances of gmolpro at the same time (Mac)"
msgstr "同时运行多个 gmolpro 实例（Mac）"

msgid ""
"To run several instances of gmolpro at the same time on Mac, open a terminal"
" and type in the terminal:"
msgstr "要在 Mac 上同时运行多个 gmolpro 实例，请打开终端并在终端中输入："

msgid "``/Applications/gmolpro.app/Contents/MacOS/gmolpro &``"
msgstr "``/Applications/gmolpro.app/Contents/MacOS/gmolpro &``"

msgid "for each instance required."
msgstr "每个所需实例执行一次。"

msgid "Retina screens (Mac)"
msgstr "Retina 屏幕（Mac）"

msgid ""
"If the molecule is not properly displayed, e.g. like this `retina1.png "
"<media/retina1.png>`__ or like that:"
msgstr "如果分子显示不正确，例如像这样 `retina1.png <media/retina1.png>`__ 或那样："

msgid "retina2.png"
msgstr "retina2.png"

msgid "-> Please use the switch Display/Retina screen."
msgstr "-> 请使用 Display/Retina screen 开关。"

msgid ""
"This switches between factor 1 and 2. If you need a more general factor, "
"please edit the line in $HOME/.pqsmol/gmolpro.conf where it says:"
msgstr "该开关在因子 1 和 2 之间切换。如果需要更通用的因子，请编辑 $HOME/.pqsmol/gmolpro.conf 中的以下行："

msgid "retina_factor   1.000000"
msgstr "retina_factor   1.000000"

msgid "and insert the factor needed."
msgstr "并填入所需的因子。"

msgid "For developers: Using a different Molpro version"
msgstr "面向开发者：使用不同的 Molpro 版本"

msgid ""
"From version 2.0.0 on (and from 2.7.0, only the Mac version), gmolpro is "
"bundled with Molpro, and uses this version of Molpro. If you do not want to "
"use the Molpro version in the bundle, then this can be achieved in the "
"following way. Open a terminal, and:"
msgstr ""
"从 2.0.0 版起（以及从 2.7.0 版起，仅限 Mac 版），gmolpro 与 Molpro 捆绑在一起，并使用此版本的 "
"Molpro。如果不希望使用捆绑中的 Molpro 版本，可以通过以下方式实现。打开终端并："

msgid "If you use bash, export MOLPRO_ROOT:"
msgstr "如果使用 bash，请导出 MOLPRO_ROOT："

msgid "``export MOLPRO_ROOT=/path/to/your/molproversion/``"
msgstr "``export MOLPRO_ROOT=/path/to/your/molproversion/``"

msgid ""
"where ``/path/to/your/molproversion/bin/molpro`` should be the script to run"
" Molpro, and the binary should be found at "
"``/path/to/your/molproversion/bin/molpro.exe``"
msgstr ""
"其中 ``/path/to/your/molproversion/bin/molpro`` 应是运行 Molpro 的脚本，二进制文件应位于 "
"``/path/to/your/molproversion/bin/molpro.exe``"

msgid ""
"Then start gmolpro from the same terminal (note that on Mac, you cannot use "
"a version installed in the Dock, as MOLPRO_ROOT is only known in the "
"terminal where it was exported; also .bashrc is not read when you open "
"gmolpro by clicking its icon in the Dock)"
msgstr ""
"然后从同一终端启动 gmolpro（注意在 Mac 上不能使用安装在 Dock 中的版本，因为 MOLPRO_ROOT "
"仅在导出它的终端中已知；此外通过点击 Dock 图标打开 gmolpro 时不会读取 .bashrc）"
